<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Island View half yr shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Island View half yr shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		70.8	  vs 44.4</p>
<p>    - net income	    72.4	  vs 45.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 17.5	  vs 14.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   18.3	  vs 11.4</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   26.6	  vs 17.6</p>
<p>    Tax			 8.3	   vs 6.2</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.1	   vs 1.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		  224.9	 vs 201.6</p>
<p>Full name: Island View Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they expected to achieve a satisfactory increase in earnings for the full year but at a lower rate than that achieved in the first half.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
